Game assets notice

This package contains modified copies of Unity asset bundles extracted from
the game "Nobody - The Turnaround". Those assets remain the property of their
respective rights holders. The package is distributed as an unofficial,
non-commercial fan translation and does not contain the game itself. It is
intended for use only by owners of a legitimate copy of the game.
